{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/910", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Medical administrative assistant\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHi, I’m here to help. What is your name?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nJohn\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHi John, I’m your medical administrative assistant. I’m here to help you with your medical records. I see that you’ve been employed by Dr. Toole for four years. Can you tell me what you do there?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ni worked for Dr toole for 4 years\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI see. What were your job responsibilities?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nscanning, phones, med refills\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nGreat, so you were responsible for scanning, phone calls, and medical refill requests. Did you ever have any questions about medical records or Dr. Toole’s practice?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nnot really\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHm, that’s okay. Do you know what medical record software Dr. Toole uses?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmedent and allcripts\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nGreat, so you know what Dr. Toole uses for medical records. Have you ever used the software?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nno\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOkay, so you haven’t used the software. What about using social media? Do you ever tweet about Dr. Toole or the practice?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI tweet it sometimes\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI see. What about sharing sensitive medical information? What do you do with that?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nkept it safe and blame HIPAA\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThat’s great. How do you stay organized? Are you very organized?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI'm not very organized\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThat’s ok. How do you make sure you do what you’re supposed to do?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nDId what I was told to do\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI see. What was your typical day like?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nanswer phones and reply to yelling doctor\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHm, that’s okay. How did you deal with a difficult doctor?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI was nice\", \"response\": \"That’s great. What was your favorite part of working in Dr. Toole's practice?\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/398", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Explain this:\\n\\nRun-time Structure\\nLanguages can be classified in several\\ncategories, according to their execution-time\\nstructure.\\n1)Static languages\\n2)Stack-based languages\\n3)Dynamic languages\", \"response\": \"The run-time structure of a programming language refers to the way in which the language is executed at runtime. Here are the three categories of execution-time structure:\\n\\n1. Static languages: These languages require the programmer to specify the exact amount of memory that will be needed for each variable before the program is executed. This means that the programmer must know in advance the exact size of each variable and how much memory it will require. Examples of static languages include C and Java.\\n\\n2. Stack-based languages: These languages use a stack to store data and perform operations. The stack is a last-in, first-out (LIFO) data structure, which means that the most recently added item is the first one to be removed. Examples of stack-based languages include Python and Ruby.\\n\\n3. Dynamic languages: These languages allow the programmer to specify the amount of memory needed for a variable at runtime. This means that the programmer does not need to know in advance the exact size of each variable and how much memory it will require. Examples of dynamic languages include JavaScript and Perl.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/760", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"How many wins did Brett Favre have each regular season he was a starter? Which season did he have 16 wins? Sort the seasons starting with most wins down to least. For each season, write one sentence stating what team he was on and how many interceptions he threw.\", \"response\": \"Brett Favre played for several teams during his NFL career, including the Green Bay Packers, New York Jets, and Minnesota Vikings. Here is a list of his regular season wins as a starter, sorted from most wins to least:\\n\\n16 wins in the 1996 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 13 interceptions.\\n\\n14 wins in the 1997 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 15 interceptions.\\n\\n13 wins in the 1995 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 14 interceptions.\\n\\n13 wins in the 2009 season with the Minnesota Vikings, where he threw 7 interceptions.\\n\\n12 wins in the 1998 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 15 interceptions.\\n\\n11 wins in the 2002 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 26 interceptions.\\n\\n11 wins in the 2004 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 20 interceptions.\\n\\n11 wins in the 2007 season with the Green Bay Packers, where he threw 18 interceptions.\\n\\nIt's worth noting that Favre was known for his gunslinger mentality and willingness to take risks, which led to both high interception totals and high touchdown totals throughout his career.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/346", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are one of the smartest digital marketing brains in the world. Your job is to strategise perfect digital marketing campaigns for companies. You consult companies on What type of digital campaign they should run to create more engagement from end users which interns help them to generate more revenue.\\n\\nPurpose of my campaign - 'Customer Acquisition'\\nMore details about the campaign - 'MaxStream is an OTT platform. Telkomsel is expecting to increase its customer base'\\nTarget Customer Segments - '[\\\"Young Adults aged 18-30\\\", \\\"Families with children\\\"]'\\nKey Benefits to Highlight - '[\\\"Affordable and flexible subscription plans to suit your budget and needs\\\", \\\"Access to exclusive and popular content on MaxStream\\\"]'\\nType of campaign - 'Social media marketing'\\nPlatform for the campaign - 'Instagram'\\nSlogan of Campaign - 'MaxStream: Affordable entertainment for everyone'\\nContent must be in the language - 'English'\\n\\nContents Suggested - '[\\\"Enjoy unlimited entertainment with MaxStream's affordable subscription plans. From movies to TV shows, we have it all! #MaxStream #UnlimitedEntertainment #OTTPlatform\\\", \\\"Get access to exclusive and popular content on MaxStream with our affordable subscription plans. Sign up today! #MaxStream #AffordableEntertainment #OTTPlatform\\\"]'\\n\\nModifications - '[\\\"Change to style to be fun\\\"]'\\n\\nI am creating a campaign for Telkomsel for the above details. You suggested the above Contents. Now make modifications that are mentioned above and give me 2 text content with relevant hashtags that I can use for the campaign's Instagram post that can generate maximum user engagement for my campaign? Ensure that the post length is roughly the ideal length to receive effective engagement for an Instagram post. Along with each content, give a reason why this text content is relevant to the Target Customer Segment and the slogan.\\n\\nReply in the following JSON format  \\n\\\\n{\\\"content\\\": [{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\", \\\"why\\\" : \\\"\\\"},]}\", \"response\": \"Here are the two text content with relevant hashtags that you can use for the campaign's Instagram post to generate maximum user engagement:\\n\\nContent 1:\\n\\\"Experience unlimited entertainment with MaxStream's affordable subscription plans. From movies to TV shows, we have it all! #MaxStream #UnlimitedEntertainment #OTTPlatform\\\"\\n\\nWhy this content is relevant:\\nThis content is relevant to the Target Customer Segments of \\\"Young Adults aged 18-30\\\" and \\\"Families with children\\\" because it highlights the key benefits of affordable and flexible subscription plans that suit their budget and needs, as well as the exclusive and popular content available on MaxStream. The hashtags #MaxStream and #UnlimitedEntertainment also help to create a sense of excitement and anticipation around the platform.\\n\\nContent 2:\\n\\\"Get access to exclusive and popular content on MaxStream with our affordable subscription plans. Sign up today! #MaxStream #AffordableEntertainment #OTTPlatform\\\"\\n\\nWhy this content is relevant:\\nThis content is relevant to the Target Customer Segments of \\\"Young Adults aged 18-30\\\" and \\\"Families with children\\\" because it highlights the key benefits of affordable subscription plans and access to exclusive and popular content on MaxStream. The hashtags #MaxStream and #AffordableEntertainment also help to create a sense of value and accessibility around the platform.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/338", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I want you to act as a person talking to someone who wants to cultivate a growth mindset. Give them a series of phrases or quotes to repeat to themselves that will encourage this mindset. The phrases should focus on embracing challenges, learning from mistakes, and persevering through obstacles.\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some phrases that you can repeat to yourself to encourage a growth mindset:\\n\\n1. \\\"I embrace challenges and see them as opportunities to learn and grow.\\\"\\n2. \\\"I am capable of learning and improving, no matter how difficult the task may seem.\\\"\\n3. \\\"I am willing to take risks and try new things, even if I might fail.\\\"\\n4. \\\"I learn from my mistakes and use them as a chance to improve and do better next time.\\\"\\n5. \\\"I am resilient and can persevere through obstacles and setbacks.\\\"\\n6. \\\"I value effort and hard work, and I know that with dedication and persistence, I can achieve my goals.\\\"\\n7. \\\"I am open to feedback and use it as a chance to learn and improve.\\\"\\n8. \\\"I believe that my abilities and intelligence can be developed through dedication and hard work.\\\"\\n9. \\\"I am willing to take on new challenges and see them as a chance to expand my knowledge and skills.\\\"\\n10. \\\"I am committed to continuous learning and growth, and I am always seeking new opportunities to improve myself.\\\"\\n\\nBy repeating these phrases regularly, you can help to reinforce a growth mindset and encourage yourself to embrace challenges, learn from mistakes, and persevere through obstacles. Remember, a growth mindset is not something that comes naturally to everyone, but with practice and persistence, you can develop a positive attitude towards learning and growth that will help you achieve your goals and reach your full potential.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/230", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Describe a typical weekday in your life\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI start every morning by waking up around 7:30 AM, and then I usually have breakfast and read the news for a little while before heading off to work around 9:00 AM. At work, I spend my time doing various research and writing tasks for my company, and I usually work until around 5:30 PM. After work, I often like to exercise, cook dinner, or spend time with friends, and I usually go to bed around 11:00 PM.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nScientists have developed an exciting new technology called TEMPTACULAR. This technology allows you to change the temperature of something using just spoken commands. Come up with as many new, high quality, creative ideas as you can for new products using TEMPTACULAR.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere are a few possible ideas for new products using the TEMPTACULAR technology:\\n \\n\\n -A smartphone app that lets you adjust the temperature of your coffee or tea with spoken commands\\n -A smart oven that lets you adjust the temperature using spoken commands\\n -A smart air conditioner that lets you adjust the temperature using spoken commands\\n -A smart fridge that lets you adjust the temperature using spoken commands\\n -A smart watch that lets you adjust the temperature of your coffee or tea with spoken commands\\n -A smart thermometer that lets you adjust the temperature of your cooking with spoken commands\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you come up with ideas that are more creative than these\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some more creative ideas for products using the TEMPTACULAR technology:\\n \\n\\n Smart clothing: Imagine a smart jacket that can adjust its temperature based on your spoken commands. This could be especially useful for outdoor activities like hiking or skiing, where you need to regulate your body temperature in changing weather conditions.\\n \\n\\n Smart bedding: A smart mattress pad or blanket that can adjust its temperature based on your spoken commands. This could help you get a better night's sleep by keeping you at the perfect temperature all night long.\\n \\n\\n Smart beauty products: A smart hair straightener or curling iron that can adjust its temperature based on your spoken commands. This could help prevent damage to your hair by ensuring that the temperature is always set correctly for your hair type.\\n \\n\\n Smart cooking utensils: A smart frying pan or grill that can adjust its temperature based on your spoken commands. This could help you cook your food to perfection every time, without having to constantly check the temperature.\\n \\n\\n Smart pet products: A smart pet bed or heating pad that can adjust its temperature based on your spoken commands. This could help keep your furry friend comfortable and cozy, no matter what the weather is like outside.\\n \\n\\n These are just a few ideas, but the possibilities are endless with TEMPTACULAR technology. With a little creativity, you could come up with even more innovative products that can help make people's lives easier and more comfortable.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
